[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589731825","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101533#issuecomment-2589731825","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101533","id":2589731825,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aXCvx","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T12:01:09Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T12:46:27Z","body":"> Just one more comment, otherwise it looks good to me!\r\n> \r\n> I do wonder, with all these functions, are the point creation functions (`redraw`) called often or just once? Because if they're called just once, optimizing them wouldn't be of much benefit, as the grunt work would be performed by the actual draw call.\r\n\r\nFrom what I can see, they are called on creation and every time you change a property of the gizmo. But this function is exposed to scripts as well, so doesn't mean some script doesn't call it every frame. Even if it wasn't, 130k cycles overhead **per** gizmo creation/edition is way too much for me to look the other way (so to speak).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589731825/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590130830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101533#issuecomment-2590130830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101533","id":2590130830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aYkKO","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T14:50:41Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T14:52:47Z","body":"> I do wonder, with all these functions, are the point creation functions (redraw) called often or just once?\r\n\r\nThey are called when a gizmo changes visibility state from the editor plugin side (selection, deselection, node type gizmo menu) or when e.g. the node calls update_gizmos(), e.g. in a setter for some node or subresource properties that affect the visuals.\r\n\r\nFor nodes that have editor draggable editor plugin handles they are called every frame while e.g. a vertex is dragged around with the mouse.\r\n\r\nIf a gizmo updates for no reason because every pointless function had an update_gizmo() call added just for good measure that would likely be an oversight / bug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590130830/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2663729081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101533#issuecomment-2663729081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101533","id":2663729081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6exUe5","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-17T17:28:26Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T17:28:26Z","body":"Note that there are some more capsule gizmos out there, such as the one from the SpringBoneCollisionCapsule3D node.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/god